프트웨어는","x":1171,"y":843,"width":211,"height":40},{"text":"공개","x":1394,"y":844,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"소스이지만","x":1478,"y":842,"width":175,"height":39}]},{"text":"일부 공개 소스 소프트웨어는 “무료가 아니다. GNU/Linux는 가장 유명한 공개 소스","words":[{"text":"일부","x":313,"y":906,"width":65,"height":40},{"text":"공개","x":390,"y":907,"width":65,"height":40},{"text":"소스","x":470,"y":910,"width":66,"height":31},{"text":"소프트웨어는","x":549,"y":907,"width":198,"height":40},{"text":"“무료가","x":760,"y":909,"width":129,"height":40},{"text":"아니다.","x":902,"y":908,"width":107,"height":40},{"text":"GNU/Linux는","x":1024,"y":911,"width":256,"height":37},{"text":"가장","x":1294,"y":909,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"유명한","x":1378,"y":910,"width":109,"height":39},{"text":"공개","x":1500,"y":908,"width":68,"height":41},{"text":"소스","x":1585,"y":911,"width":67,"height":30}]},{"text":"운영체제이며, 일부 배포판은 무료이고 다른 배포판은 단지 공개 소스일 뿐이다(http://","words":[{"text":"운영체제이며,","x":310,"y":972,"width":208,"height":42},{"text":"일부","x":535,"y":973,"width":64,"height":40},{"text":"배포판은","x":612,"y":973,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"무료이고","x":757,"y":974,"width":135,"height":40},{"text":"다른","x":906,"y":974,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"배포판은","x":988,"y":974,"width":136,"height":40},{"text":"단지","x":1136,"y":974,"width":64,"height":40},{"text":"공개","x":1218,"y":975,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"소스일","x":1303,"y":976,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"뿐이다(http://","x":1424,"y":975,"width":229,"height":42}]},{"text":"www.gnu.org/distros/). Microsoft Windows는 반대 개념인 비공개 소스 방식의 잘","words":[{"text":"www.gnu.org/distros/).","x":309,"y":1041,"width":385,"height":41},{"text":"Microsoft","x":708,"y":1042,"width":164,"height":32},{"text":"Windows는","x":885,"y":1042,"width":200,"height":36},{"text":"반대","x":1098,"y":1040,"width":63,"height":40},{"text":"개념인","x":1179,"y":1040,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"비공개","x":1297,"y":1041,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"소스","x":1414,"y":1045,"width":73,"height":30},{"text":"방식의","x":15